          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " told Moses ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to take a census of the Levite clan of Gershon by sub-clans and families, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and to register all the men between the ages of thirty and fifty who were qualified to work in the Tent of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s presence. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall be responsible for carrying the following objects: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the Tent, its inner cover, its outer cover, the fine leather cover on top of it, the curtain for the entrance, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the curtains and ropes for the court that is round the Tent and the altar, the curtains for the entrance of the court, and all the fittings used in setting up these objects. They shall perform all the tasks required for these things. ",
